  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 他们的上海话说得比上海人都好！（Fu大爷X托比亚斯）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65abf58da8f15b5c1cb16802</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65abf58da8f15b5c1cb16802</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jan 2024 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>（应广大听众的要求，本期节目仍然是沪语版。如您有收听障碍，可以拉着身边的上海朋友一起收听，让他同声传译，还可以顺便安利一下《310电波》。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们请到了一位比利时朋友和一位北京朋友，跟他们用上海话无障碍交流了一整期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么这些外国朋友、外地朋友眼里的上海是什么样的？他们是怎么学说上海话的？他们的上海情结有哪些？他们眼里的海派文化又是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期超多笑料，请各位听众老爷点开正片解锁吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>瓜哥（小红书/抖音@瓜哥脱口秀）</span></p><span></span><p><span>罗易（@罗易不容易）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fu大爷 - 兼职脱口秀演员（微信视频号@脱口秀Fu大爷，抖音/小红书：Fu大爷）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tobias-高悦（抖音：@Tobias-高悦，小红书：@老外托比亚斯 - Tobias，视频号：@托比亚斯Tobias）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期策划】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小王啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 比利时人的上海话这么正宗？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 托老师住石库门？“老上海人了”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 弄堂里能学到老派上海话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 外地人/外国人学的第一句上海话都是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 北京人对上海的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 学说上海话才能真正融入上海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 上海人都不去东方明珠的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 外地人/外国人的上海情结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 北京人喝豆汁就像上海人喝咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">65:50</a> 上海的烟火气</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【合作联系】</span></p><span></span><p><span>love310dianbo@126.com</span></p>]]></description>
